  "sentences": [
   {
    "line": "The next generation of property professionals will operate differently.",
    "index": 1,
    "from": 0.632,
    "to": 4.394,
    "speech_seconds": 3.76,
    "voice_db": -19.3,
    "music_db": -31.7,
    "margin_db": 12.4
   },
   {
    "line": "Not because they'll use more software, not because they'll have more dashboards, and not because AI became another tab.",
    "index": 2,
    "from": 4.497,
    "to": 11.753,
    "speech_seconds": 7.25,
    "voice_db": -19.7,
    "music_db": -30.7,
    "margin_db": 11
   },
   {
    "line": "At a certain level of ambition, the question changes.",
    "index": 3,
    "from": 12.182,
    "to": 15.459,
    "speech_seconds": 3.26,
    "voice_db": -19.1,
    "music_db": -32.8,
    "margin_db": 13.7
   },
   {
    "line": "Research, clients, reports, finance, communication.",
    "index": 4,
    "from": 15.843,
    "to": 20.611,
    "speech_seconds": 4.76,
    "voice_db": -22.1,
    "music_db": -32.1,
    "margin_db": 10
   },
   {
    "line": "Powerful on their own.",
    "index": 5,
    "from": 20.733,
    "to": 22.055,
    "speech_seconds": 1.3,
    "voice_db": -19.5,
    "music_db": -37.9,
    "margin_db": 18.4
   },
   {
    "line": "More valuable when they stop behaving like separate destinations.",
    "index": 6,
    "from": 22.55,
    "to": 27.164,
    "speech_seconds": 4.58,
    "voice_db": -22.9,
    "music_db": -32.7,
    "margin_db": 9.8
   },
   {
    "line": "When intelligence can move, when context can follow, when the business can act as one.",
    "index": 7,
    "from": 27.723,
    "to": 33.807,
    "speech_seconds": 6.02,
    "voice_db": -23,
    "music_db": -33.5,
    "margin_db": 10.5
   },
   {
    "line": "So don't ask what the next tool is.",
    "index": 8,
    "from": 34.237,
    "to": 36.333,
    "speech_seconds": 2.08,
    "voice_db": -18.9,
    "music_db": -32.7,
    "margin_db": 13.8
   },
   {
    "line": "Ask what happens when the business becomes the system.",
    "index": 9,
    "from": 36.576,
    "to": 39.749,
    "speech_seconds": 3.14,
    "voice_db": -23.4,
    "music_db": -35,
    "margin_db": 11.6
   },
   {
    "line": "Aurixa Systems.",
    "index": 10,
    "from": 40.252,
    "to": 41.473,
    "speech_seconds": 1.2,
    "voice_db": -16.4,
    "music_db": -28.9,
    "margin_db": 12.5
   },
   {
